msgstr "非物理系へのマッピングの例 {#example-mapping-to-non-physical-systems}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum cut (max-cut) problem is a combinatorial optimization problem "
"that involves dividing the vertices of a graph into two disjoint sets such "
"that the number of edges between the two sets is maximized. More formally, "
"given an undirected graph $G=(V,E)$, where $V$ is the set of vertices and "
"$E$ is the set of edges, the max-cut problem asks to partition the vertices "
"into two disjoint subsets, $S$ and $T$, such that the number of edges with "
"one endpoint in $S$ and the other in $T$ is maximized.\n"
msgstr ""
"Max-Cut はクラスタリング、ネットワーク設計、相転移など、さまざまな問題を解くために応用できます。まず問題グラフを作成してみましょう：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can apply max-cut to solve a various problems including: clustering, "
"network design, phase transitions, and so on. We'll start by creating a "
"problem graph:\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/cost-functions/extracted-"
"outputs/739ca7a0-fae3-4389-a8de-7ae93c13b9e1-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/cost-functions/extracted-"
"outputs/739ca7a0-fae3-4389-a8de-7ae93c13b9e1-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"この問題は2値最適化問題として表現できます。グラフのノード数を $n$（この場合は $n=4$）として、各ノード $0 \\leq i < n$ "
"に対して2値変数 $x_i$ を考えます。この変数は、ノード $i$ がグループ $1$ と呼ぶ集合に属する場合は $1$、グループ $0$ "
"と呼ぶ集合に属する場合は $0$ の値をとります。また、$w_{ij}$（隣接行列 $w$ の要素 $(i,j)$）をノード $i$ からノード $j$"
" へ向かう辺の重みとします。グラフが無向であるため $w_{ij}=w_{ji}$ "
"が成り立ちます。そして、次のコスト関数を最大化する問題として定式化できます：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This problem can be expressed as a binary optimization problem. For each "
"node $0 \\leq i < n$, where $n$ is the number of nodes of the graph (in this"
" case $n=4$), we will consider the binary variable $x_i$. This variable will"
" have the value $1$ if node $i$ is one of the groups that we'll label $1$ "
"and $0$ if it's in the other group, that we'll label as $0$. We will also "
"denote as $w_{ij}$ (element $(i,j)$ of the adjacency matrix $w$) the weight "
"of the edge that goes from node $i$ to node $j$. Because the graph is "
"undirected, $w_{ij}=w_{ji}$. Then we can formulate our problem as maximizing"
" the following cost function:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C(\\vec{x})\n"
"& =\\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i(1-x_j)\\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C(\\vec{x})\n"
"& =\\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i(1-x_j)\\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr "& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i - \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_ix_j\\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i - \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_ix_j\\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr ""
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i - \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i 2w_{ij} x_ix_j\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} x_i - \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i 2w_{ij} x_ix_j\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"この問題を量子コンピューターで解くために、コスト関数を観測量の期待値として表現します。ただし、Qiskit "
"がネイティブにサポートする観測量はパウリ演算子で構成されており、その固有値は $0$ と $1$ ではなく $1$ と $-1$ "
"です。そこで、次のような変数変換を行います：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To solve this problem with a quantum computer, we are going to express the "
"cost function as the expected value of an observable. However, the "
"observables that Qiskit admits natively consist of Pauli operators, that "
"have eigenvalues $1$ and $-1$ instead of $0$ and $1$. That's why we are "
"going to make the following change of variable:\n"
msgstr ""
"ここで $\\vec{x}=(x_0,x_1,\\cdots ,x_{n-1})$ とします。隣接行列 $w$ "
"を使って全辺の重みに容易にアクセスできます。これを利用してコスト関数を求めます：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Where $\\vec{x}=(x_0,x_1,\\cdots ,x_{n-1})$. We can use the adjacency matrix"
" $w$ to comfortably access the weights of all the edge. This will be used to"
" obtain our cost function:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"z_i = 1-2x_i \\rightarrow x_i = \\frac{1-z_i}{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"z_i = 1-2x_i \\rightarrow x_i = \\frac{1-z_i}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "この変換は次を意味します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This implies that:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{lcl} x_i=0 & \\rightarrow & z_i=1 \\\\ x_i=1 & \\rightarrow & z_i=-1.\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{lcl} x_i=0 & \\rightarrow & z_i=1 \\\\ x_i=1 & \\rightarrow & z_i=-1.\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "したがって、最大化したい新しいコスト関数は次のようになります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "So the new cost function we want to maximize is:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C(\\vec{z})\n"
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} \\bigg(\\frac{1-z_i}{2}\\bigg)\\bigg(1-\\frac{1-z_j}{2}\\bigg)\\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C(\\vec{z})\n"
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n w_{ij} \\bigg(\\frac{1-z_i}{2}\\bigg)\\bigg(1-\\frac{1-z_j}{2}\\bigg)\\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr ""
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n \\frac{w_{ij}}{4} - \\sum_{i,j=0}^n \\frac{w_{ij}}{4} "
"z_iz_j\\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"& = \\sum_{i,j=0}^n \\frac{w_{ij}}{4} - \\sum_{i,j=0}^n \\frac{w_{ij}}{4} "
"z_iz_j\\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr ""
"& = \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} -  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} z_iz_j\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"& = \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} -  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} z_iz_j\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"さらに、量子コンピューターは最大値ではなく最小値（通常は最低エネルギー）を見つける性質があるため、$C(\\vec{z})$ "
"を最大化する代わりに、次の式を最小化します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Moreover, the natural tendency of a quantum computer is to find minima "
"(usually the lowest energy) instead of maxima so instead of maximizing "
"$C(\\vec{z})$ we are going to minimize:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"-C(\\vec{z}) =  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} z_iz_j -  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"-C(\\vec{z}) =  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} z_iz_j -  \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "変数の値が $-1$ と $1$ をとるコスト関数の最小化問題が得られたので、パウリ $Z$ との以下のアナロジーを利用できます：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that we have a cost function to minimize whose variables can have the "
"values $-1$ and $1$, we can make the following analogy with the Pauli $Z$:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"z_i \\equiv Z_i = \\overbrace{I}^{n-1}\\otimes ... \\otimes \\overbrace{Z}^{i} \\otimes ... \\otimes \\overbrace{I}^{0}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"z_i \\equiv Z_i = \\overbrace{I}^{n-1}\\otimes ... \\otimes \\overbrace{Z}^{i} \\otimes ... \\otimes \\overbrace{I}^{0}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "つまり、変数 $z_i$ は qubit $i$ に作用する $Z$ Gate と等価です。さらに：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In other words, the variable $z_i$ will be equivalent to a $Z$ gate acting "
"on qubit $i$. Moreover:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle = z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle \\rightarrow \\langle x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0 |Z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle = z_i\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle = z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle \\rightarrow \\langle x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0 |Z_i|x_{n-1}\\cdots x_0\\rangle = z_i\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "したがって、考察する観測量は次のようになります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Then the observable we are going to consider is:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{H} = \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} Z_iZ_j\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{H} = \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2} Z_iZ_j\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "そして、後からオフセット項を加える必要があります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "to which we will have to add the independent term afterwards:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\texttt{offset} = - \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\texttt{offset} = - \\sum_{i=0}^n \\sum_{j=0}^i \\frac{w_{ij}}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
"The operator is a linear combination of terms with Z operators on nodes connected by an edge (recall that the 0th qubit is farthest right): $IIZZ + IZIZ + IZZI + ZIIZ + ZZII$. Once the operator is constructed, the ansatz for the QAOA algorithm can easily be built by using the `QAOAAnsatz` circuit from the Qiskit circuit library.\n"
msgstr ""
"この演算子は、辺で接続されたノード上の Z 演算子の項の線形結合です（第0番目の qubit が最も右に位置することに注意してください）：$IIZZ +"
" IZIZ + IZZI + ZIIZ + ZZII$。演算子が構築されたら、Qiskit Circuit ライブラリの `QAOAAnsatz` "
"Circuit を使って QAOA アルゴリズム用のアンザッツを簡単に構築できます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/cost-functions/extracted-"
"outputs/29398315-3baf-4363-88fc-69b6438e4afa-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/cost-functions/extracted-"
"outputs/29398315-3baf-4363-88fc-69b6438e4afa-0.avif)\n"

