"advantage.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![A graph showing how simulation cost varies with circuit complexity. Using "
"a classical computer it grows exponentially. With quantum error mitigation, "
"there should be a crossover at which that becomes advantageous. Quantum "
"error correction allows for linear growth of the simulation cost and will "
